      "note": [
        "The compilation of the balance of payments and the international investment position makes use of certain preliminary information. The statistics will be revised in line with more definitive figures in the updated statistics.",
        "The publication of the third quarter of 2022 includes revised data on compensation of employees to and from abroad from 2015 and onwards. The reason for this revision is that the Balance of Payments has introduced new sources. Data on compensation of employees to Sweden is compiled using the Swedish income and tax register (IoT). Data on compensation of employees from Sweden is compiled using declarations of employer on individual level (AGI). ",
        "For the quarter three 2023, a correction of reported errors has been performed regarding financial derivates. This affects the item 3.3 Financial derivates within the balance of payments. In connection with the publication of 2023Q3, the previous reported errors have been corrected for 2023Q2.  As a result of the changes, there will be a time series break between 2023Q1 and 2023Q2. Statistics Sweden will address this break in future publications. ",
        "In connection with the publication of first quarter 2024, information regarding account item 3.3 financial derivatives has been revised from first quarter 2013 up to and including first quarter 2023. The revision is based on model estimates and involves a certain degree of uncertainty. The new data is judged to be of higher quality than previously published series.",
        "2026-03-06: When publishing the third quarter of 2025, it was discovered that revisions for the period 2013–2018 had been published incorrectly, as they referred to revisions linked to the publication of the second quarter of 2025. The information has now been corrected and replaced with the accurate values."
      ],
